==============================================================================

  Component : com.typesafe.akka:akka-* (2.6.12)
              com.typesafe.akka:akka-http-* (10.2.4)
  Current   : Apache-2.0
  Risk      : Akka was relicensed under the Business Source License 1.1
              (BSL) in September 2022, starting with Akka 2.7.0. BSL is
              Category X and must not appear in an Apache release.
              The versions pinned in build/openwhisk/settings.gradle
